  "content": "<section>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">此模組為 Croptopia 添加了使用 Create 機器的配方。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">新增內容：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">許多既有物品的配方</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">新增物品的配方</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">流體的方塊版本（來自 Croptopia 與本模組）</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">模組需求</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&nbsp;– Croptopia：必要<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&nbsp;– Create：<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">必要</span></span><br></span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>製作團隊</strong></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fxonox%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xonox</a> 是展示圖片中使用的 <a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fepic-medieval-city-with-redstone-surprises-ville-m-di-vale-mittelalter-stadt%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">「Epic Medieval City with Redstone Surprises」</a> 的創作者。</span></p>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">使用許可</span></strong></h4>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&nbsp;– 允許將本模組用於整合包中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">&nbsp;– 禁止在本模組整合包以外的任何地方上傳。</span></p>\n</section>",
